# =============================================================================
# WiSense / get-started
#
# TRACK (push to git):
#   python/**/*.py, scripts/*.sh, docs/*.md
#   requirements.txt, .env.example
#   data/processed/preprocess_config.json  (small preprocess metadata)
#
# IGNORE (local / large / regeneratable):
#   data/raw/**                      raw CSI CSVs, capture logs
#   data/processed/*.npz             preprocessed tensors
#   models/**                        trained model artifacts
#   venv/, .venv/                    local Python virtualenv
#   __pycache__/, *.pyc
# =============================================================================

# --- Local Python environment ---
venv/
.venv/
tools/venv/

# --- Raw CSI captures (multi-GB; back up outside git) ---
data/raw/**/*.csv
data/raw/**/*.log
data/raw/**/*.manifest

# --- Preprocessed tensors (regenerate via preprocess_csi.py) ---
data/processed/*.npz
data/processed/preprocess_manifest.csv

# --- Trained models (regenerate via python/train/) ---
models/**/*
!models/.gitkeep

# --- Dataset bundle / ad-hoc captures ---
data.zip
dataset.zip
*.csv
!firmware/**/partitions.csv

# --- Python bytecode ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# --- Firmware build artifacts ---
firmware/**/build/

# --- Local env ---
.env

# --- Local text logs (keep requirements.txt and ESP-IDF CMakeLists) ---
*.txt
!requirements.txt
!firmware/**/CMakeLists.txt

data/dataset/
*.npz

# --- IDE workspace (Android Studio opened at repo root) ---
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Firebase app configs (contain per-project client IDs; see *.example) ---
mobile/resident-app/google-services.json
mobile/caregiver-app/google-services.json